  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「ハマスゲ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8F%E3%83%9E%E3%82%B9%E3%82%B2",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 106371393,
      "text": "ハマスゲ は、乾地に生えるカヤツリグサの1種。雑草としてよく見かけられ、また薬草として利用される。中国名は香附子。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Cyperus rotundus」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyperus_rotundus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1357015832,
      "text": "Cyperus rotundus is a species of sedge (Cyperaceae) native to Africa, southern and central Europe, and southern Asia. The word cyperus derives from the Greek κύπερος, kyperos, and rotundus is from Latin, meaning \"round\". The earliest attested form of the word cyperus is the Mycenaean Greek 𐀓𐀞𐀫, ku-pa-ro, written in Linear B syllabic script."
    }
  },
